  "description": "Rustic Christmas Plaid & Gingham is a cozy seamless digital paper collection inspired by traditional holiday textiles, farmhouse décor, and timeless woven patterns. The collection features classic plaid, tartan, gingham, checkered, and layered stripe designs in warm Christmas colors and rustic neutral tones.\nRich reds, forest greens, cream, beige, brown, burgundy, and muted olive shades create a warm vintage farmhouse aesthetic. A variety of large and small checks, traditional tartans, windowpane grids, woven textures, and distressed textile details provide plenty of visual variety while maintaining a cohesive rustic holiday style.\nFeatures:\n• 26 Seamless Digital Paper Designs\n• Rustic Christmas Plaid & Gingham Theme\n• Traditional Tartan & Check Patterns\n• Classic Gingham Designs\n• Farmhouse-Inspired Plaid Patterns\n• Red, Green, Cream & Burgundy Palette\n• Warm Brown & Neutral Tones\n• Layered Stripe & Grid Patterns\n• Woven Textile-Inspired Details\n• Vintage & Distressed Texture Effects\n• Cozy Country Christmas Aesthetic\n• Seamless Repeating Patterns\n• JPG Format\n• 300 DPI High Resolution\nPerfect for Christmas scrapbooking, gift wrapping, greeting cards, invitations, farmhouse stationery, planners, journals, fabric projects, quilting, printable crafts, packaging, holiday backgrounds, seasonal décor, and other creative projects.\nAdd a cozy rustic farmhouse feeling to your holiday designs with this versatile Plaid & Gingham digital paper collection.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Rustic Christmas Plaid &amp; Gingham is a cozy seamless digital paper collection inspired by traditional holiday textiles, farmhouse décor, and timeless woven patterns. The collection features classic plaid, tartan, gingham, checkered, and layered stripe designs in warm Christmas colors and rustic neutral tones.</p>\n<p>Rich reds, forest greens, cream, beige, brown, burgundy, and muted olive shades create a warm vintage farmhouse aesthetic. A variety of large and small checks, traditional tartans, windowpane grids, woven textures, and distressed textile details provide plenty of visual variety while maintaining a cohesive rustic holiday style.</p>\n<p>Features:<br>\n• 26 Seamless Digital Paper Designs<br>\n• Rustic Christmas Plaid &amp; Gingham Theme<br>\n• Traditional Tartan &amp; Check Patterns<br>\n• Classic Gingham Designs<br>\n• Farmhouse-Inspired Plaid Patterns<br>\n• Red, Green, Cream &amp; Burgundy Palette<br>\n• Warm Brown &amp; Neutral Tones<br>\n• Layered Stripe &amp; Grid Patterns<br>\n• Woven Textile-Inspired Details<br>\n• Vintage &amp; Distressed Texture Effects<br>\n• Cozy Country Christmas Aesthetic<br>\n• Seamless Repeating Patterns<br>\n• JPG Format<br>\n• 300 DPI High Resolution</p>\n<p>Perfect for Christmas scrapbooking, gift wrapping, greeting cards, invitations, farmhouse stationery, planners, journals, fabric projects, quilting, printable crafts, packaging, holiday backgrounds, seasonal décor, and other creative projects.</p>\n<p>Add a cozy rustic farmhouse feeling to your holiday designs with this versatile Plaid &amp; Gingham digital paper collection.</p>",
